::ILANG
[TYPE:config][PROJECT:vps-deals][LANG:zh]
::STATE{@SITE, brand:vps-deals, niche:VPS hosting, domain:vps-deals-promo-radar-4bq.pages.dev, locale:en-US}
::MODULE{SETTINGS|title:渲染与更新规则}
base_url = https://vps-deals-promo-radar-4bq.pages.dev
repository = https://github.com/oukiki2026/vps-deals-promo-radar
tagline = Official-source VPS offers. Clear terms. No invented coupons.
cron = 17 */6 * * *
max_age_hours = 48
fields = title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at
pages = index provider deal compare methodology
::MODULE{PROVIDERS|title:抓哪几家 这里改了站就变}
IONOS | https://www.ionos.com | https://www.ionos.com/servers/vps |
DigitalOcean | https://www.digitalocean.com | https://www.digitalocean.com/pricing/droplets |
Hetzner | https://www.hetzner.com | https://www.hetzner.com/cloud/ |
::RULE{抓不到当期价格或真实型号⇒不生成优惠记录;保留厂商页显示暂无可核验价格}
::RULE{robots不允许或抓取失败⇒不绕过;本轮移除该来源优惠;公开抓取状态}
::RULE{valid_until已过或记录超过max_age_hours⇒下架;不推测有效期}
::RULE{更新频率来自cron;运行时纯Python标准库;不使用推理API}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金 编销量 把原价续费价当当期售价|scope:permanent}
